{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605231818340a6d614ac83240ae","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_e90b64d397a340f48a41c2e8","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Write cultivation factory tests","prompt":"Write comprehensive test files for the cultivation factory game at D:/game-projects/steam-cultivation-factory/tests/.\n\nThe project uses vitest (configured in package.json). Create the following test files:\n\n### tests/gameState.test.ts\nTest the GameState module (src/game/GameState.ts). Read the source first, then write tests for:\n- createInitialState() returns valid state\n- addResources() works correctly\n- addCultivation() updates both realm AND cultivation state (after bug fix)\n- Save/load roundtrip (save to localStorage, load back, compare)\n- Migration logic (simulate old version save data, verify migration adds new fields)\n- cloneState produces independent copy\n\n### tests/resources.test.ts\nTest src/game/Resources.ts:\n- collectFromBuilding for mining buildings\n- tickAutoProduction increments resources for auto buildings\n- canAfford checks\n- deductCost reduces resources\n- formatAmount displays correctly for different magnitudes\n\n### tests/cultivation.test.ts\nTest src/game/Cultivation.ts:\n- Realm progression from liqi to zhuji\n- Breakthrough success/failure\n- canBreakthrough checks\n- addCultivationExp with level caps\n- Realm unlock conditions\n\n### tests/alchemy.test.ts\nTest src/game/Alchemy.ts:\n- Crafting starts with valid ingredients\n- Crafting fails without ingredients\n- Progress tracking\n- Collection after completion\n\n### tests/building.test.ts\nTest src/game/Building.ts:\n- canPlace validation\n- createBuildingInstance generates unique IDs\n- Building definition loading\n\n### tests/puppet.test.ts\nTest src/game/Puppet.ts:\n- Puppet state machine transitions (idle -> picking -> delivering -> idle)\n- Rule matching\n- Progress tracking\n\n### tests/conveyor.test.ts\nTest src/game/ConveyorBelt.ts:\n- Segment creation and auto-connection\n- Item spawning\n- Item movement tick\n\n### tests/inventory.test.ts\nTest src/game/Inventory.ts:\n- Pill usage increases cultivation\n- Multiple pill usage\n- Pill definitions\n\n### tests/achievement.test.ts\nTest src/game/Achievement.ts:\n- Achievement condition checking\n- Various achievement types (production, realm, automation)\n\n### tests/save.test.ts\nIntegration test for save/load:\n- Full game state save and restore\n- Conveyor/puppet/talisman state persistence\n- Version migration\n\nIMPORTANT: \n- Read the source files before writing tests to understand the actual API\n- Use proper imports from the source modules\n- Handle the fact that some modules may use DOM APIs (mock them if needed for vitest)\n- Make tests that actually test the logic, not just that functions exist\n- Each test file should be self-contained","run_in_background":true,"subagent_type":"general-purpose"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"561a5118-a4d0-464b-8f32-001690e29cb0","uuid":"b6990089-91e1-4bf6-a25d-cdb5b239599d"}
