{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605231818340a6d614ac83240ae","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_b948cc65b56f4b22809d3bef","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Write horror sim tests","prompt":"Write comprehensive test files for the horror sim game at D:/game-projects/steam-horror-sim/tests/.\n\nThe project uses vitest. Check package.json for config. Create these test files:\n\n### tests/gameState.test.ts\nTest src/game/GameState.ts:\n- createInitialState() returns valid state\n- getPhaseFromTime() for all phases (DAY, EVENING, NIGHT, DANGER, DAWN)\n- isNightTime() correctness\n- Save/load roundtrip\n- State cloning\n\n### tests/storeMap.test.ts\nTest src/game/StoreMap.ts:\n- Map initialization with correct dimensions (30x25)\n- Collision detection works\n- Tile type queries\n- Shelf positions are valid\n\n### tests/player.test.ts\nTest src/game/Player.ts:\n- Player initialization\n- Movement respects collision\n- getFacingTile() returns correct tile\n- toState() serialization\n\n### tests/customer.test.ts\nTest src/game/Customer.ts:\n- Customer states (ENTERING, BROWSING, PICKING, QUEUING, CHECKING_OUT, LEAVING)\n- Navigation between waypoints\n- Shopping behavior\n- Budget constraints\n\n### tests/cashRegister.test.ts\nTest src/game/CashRegister.ts:\n- Transaction states (IDLE, SCANNING, PAYMENT, CHANGE, RECEIPT)\n- Normal checkout flow\n- Anomaly handling doesn't leak customers (after bug fix)\n- Change calculation\n\n### tests/dayCycle.test.ts\nTest src/game/DayCycle.ts:\n- Phase transitions (DAY -> EVENING -> NIGHT -> DANGER -> DAWN -> DAY)\n- Time progression speed\n- Day increment at dawn\n- Listener callbacks fire correctly\n\n### tests/horrorEvents.test.ts\nTest src/game/HorrorEventManager.ts:\n- Event triggering respects cooldowns\n- Event levels (1-4) escalate correctly\n- Fear level accumulation\n- Probability modifiers work\n- Daily reset clears state\n\n### tests/behaviorTree.test.ts\nTest src/game/BehaviorTree.ts:\n- Selector node returns first success\n- Sequence node requires all succeed\n- NPC creation doesn't crash with null references (after bug fix)\n- NPC state transitions work\n\n### tests/saveManager.test.ts\nTest src/game/SaveManager.ts:\n- System registration\n- Save/restore roundtrip for all registered systems\n- Auto-save interval works\n- M4-M6 systems are saved (after bug fix)\n\n### tests/narrative.test.ts\nTest narrative system integration:\n- ClueManager: clue discovery, prerequisites, auto-discovery\n- StoryManager: layer progression, event acknowledgment\n- EndingSystem: ending evaluation, clue requirements\n- NoteManager: note discovery\n\n### tests/economy.test.ts\nTest src/game/EconomySystem.ts:\n- Revenue tracking\n- Debt calculation\n- Day-end settlement\n- Game over condition (day 30+ with debt)\n- Upgrade purchasing\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Read the source files before writing tests to understand the actual API\n- Use proper imports from the source modules\n- Mock DOM APIs (Canvas, localStorage, AudioContext) as needed\n- Make tests that test actual logic, not just existence\n- Each test file should be self-contained","run_in_background":true,"subagent_type":"general-purpose"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"561a5118-a4d0-464b-8f32-001690e29cb0","uuid":"3d9b1aff-6929-488d-8465-fe389cf5c141"}
